<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8f6994a0-a4c8-48b9-bede-db9a5b9c2474">
              <SHORT-NAME>Os</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the Os (Operating System) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">操作系统（Operating System）模块的配置。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">None</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00396</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:44b2af00-f4af-494b-9b23-6c4bd5ea9ca7">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsAppMode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">OsAppMode is the object used to define ISO 17356-3 properties for an ISO 17356-3 application mode.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppMode 是一个操作系统配置参数，用于定义系统启动时的应用模式，这些模式可以在系统运行时被选择以启动不同的操作系统行为或应用程序功能。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsAppMode时，需要确保定义的模式与系统设计和需求相匹配；每个模式应有明确的行为和目的；在系统启动时，只能选择一个应用模式。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <INTRODUCTION>
                    <P>
                      <L-1 L="ZH">对于应用模式（AppMode）而言，并未定义任何标准属性。在CPU中，至少需要定义一个应用模式对象。[来源：ISO 17356-6] 为确保符合ISO 17356的兼容性要求，必须始终存在一个名为​​OSDEFAULTAPPMODE​​的操作系统应用模式（OsAppMode）</L-1>
                    </P>
                  </INTRODUCTION>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00022</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3fe22410-f7c0-4ae4-a89a-e6d8c2861115">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsApplication</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">An AUTOSAR OS must be capable of supporting a collection of OS objects (tasks, interrupts, hooks etc.) that form a cohesive functional unit. This collection of objects is termed an OS-Application.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsApplication配置项用于定义操作系统应用程序的属性，它是AUTOSAR OS模块中的一个基本构建块，用于实现应用程序的隔离和保护。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsApplication时，需要确保其属性与系统的内存保护和隔离需求相符合；每个OsApplication应有唯一的标识符，并且应正确配置其访问权限和资源；在多核系统中，还需注意OsApplication与特定核心的绑定关系。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <INTRODUCTION>
                    <P>
                      <L-1 L="ZH">属于同一​​OS-Application​​的所有对象均可相互访问。此处的“访问”指允许在API服务中使用这些对象。其他应用程序的访问权限可单独授予。</L-1>
                    </P>
                  </INTRODUCTION>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00114</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>32</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a9498b30-c614-44d6-bda3-3075e560bc1e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsAppMemoryProtectionIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This optional parameter can be used to specify a memory protection identifier for the OS-Application.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppMemoryProtectionIdentifier用于标识操作系统应用程序的内存保护单元，确保应用程序之间的内存访问隔离，提高系统的安全性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使能内存保护单元后，需确保每个应用程序都配置了OsAppMemoryProtectionIdentifier。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <REQUIRES-INDEX>false</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>10</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:97ddd259-bb90-4c42-af70-aa8b24630faf">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsIsPrivileged</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameter to specify if an OS-Application is privileged or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsPrivileged配置项用于指定操作系统(OS)对象（如任务或中断服务例程）是否在特权模式下运行，这决定了它们能否访问受保护的系统资源。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，正确配置OsIsPrivileged对于系统安全性至关重要；非特权模式下的任务或ISR可能受限于访问某些资源；设计时需考虑系统的安全需求和资源访问策略。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00115</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a2dbf82-5e24-4d1b-b778-6691fa1cde23">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsAppCounterRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">References the OsCounters that belong to the OsApplication.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppCounterRef配置项用于指定操作系统应用程序所使用的计数器引用，确保应用程序能够基于指定的计数器进行时间管理和调度。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsAppCounterRef时，必须确保引用的计数器已在系统中定义且可用；此配置项对于实现时间触发的AUTOSAR OS应用程序至关重要；在多应用系统中，正确配置每个应用的计数器引用是确保时间隔离和系统稳定性的关键。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00234</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsCounter</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:493ffec7-e80e-4945-bc55-09cfe0eb4c78">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsAppEcucPartitionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Denotes which &quot;EcucPartition&quot; is implemented by this &quot;OSApplication&quot;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppEcucPartitionRef 是一个配置项，用于将 AUTOSAR OS 应用程序分区与相应的 ECUC（Electronic Control Unit Configuration）分区引用相关联，确保操作系统管理的资源与应用程序配置保持一致。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时必须确保引用的ECUC分区与OS应用程序分区匹配；此配置项对于确保操作系统的内存保护和分区管理至关重要；在多应用程序系统中，正确的分区引用对于隔离和安全性尤为重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00392</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucPartitionCollection/EcucPartition</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:ff388a32-96e2-44e3-852f-b565616152fb">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsAppIsrRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">references which OsIsrs belong to the OsApplication</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppIsrRef配置项用于定义中断服务例程（ISR）与操作系统应用程序（OsApplication）之间的关联，确保ISR的执行在指定的OsApplication上下文中进行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsAppIsrRef时，必须确保引用的ISR已经定义且与指定的OsApplication兼容；此配置项对于实现操作系统级别的隔离和安全性至关重要；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求明确ISR与OsApplication之间的关系，以支持多应用程序的隔离机制。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00221</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsIsr</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:487eb46e-c2de-4b01-8138-31906865ee1f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsApplicationCoreRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the Core Definition in the Ecuc Module where the CoreId is defined. This reference is used to describe to which Core the OsApplication is bound.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsApplicationCoreRef 配置项用于指定操作系统应用程序（OsApplication）所分配的核心（Core）引用，确保应用程序与特定的处理器核心关联。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在多核系统中，正确配置OsApplicationCoreRef对于确保应用程序的分配和隔离至关重要；必须确保引用的核心在系统中存在且可用；在配置时应遵循AUTOSAR的多核处理器支持规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00393</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucHardware/EcucCoreDefinition</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:80e78dc3-aacf-442e-8c44-5b7ede865f44">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsAppScheduleTableRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">References the OsScheduleTables that belong to the OsApplication.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppScheduleTableRef配置项用于指定OsApplication与调度表之间的映射关系。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保调度表已定义且与应用程序的需求相匹配；此配置项对于实现时间分区和确保应用程序按时执行至关重要；在多应用系统中，正确配置每个应用的OsAppScheduleTableRef是实现时间隔离的关键。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00230</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsScheduleTable</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:934a7899-f255-444b-a117-7d4ffead78e9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsAppTaskRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">references which OsTasks belong to the OsApplication</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppTaskRef 是一个配置参数，用于将操作系统任务（OsTask）与AUTOSAR应用程序（OsApplication）关联起来，确保任务在指定的应用程序上下文中执行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsAppTaskRef时，必须确保引用的OsTask已经定义并且与OsApplication兼容；此外，每个任务只能属于一个应用程序，不能跨应用程序共享；在多应用程序系统中，正确的任务与应用程序关联对于系统的安全性和隔离性至关重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00116</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsTask</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:504b9c2f-8c8f-4650-878e-fbaa905cd5c6">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsApplicationHooks</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Container to structure the OS-Application-specific hooks</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsApplicationHooks配置项用于定义操作系统应用程序钩子函数，这些钩子函数在特定的操作系统事件或状态下被调用，以实现特定的行为或处理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需确保钩子函数的使用不会导致系统的实时性和安全性降低；钩子函数应避免执行长时间操作；在配置钩子函数时，应注意其对系统资源的影响和潜在的优先级反转问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00020</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:dae2e0ce-2b38-4991-81df-93f1ebd88c4f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsAppErrorHook</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Select the OS-Application error hook.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppErrorHook配置项用于定义操作系统级别的错误钩子函数，该函数在应用程序遇到不可恢复的错误时被调用，用于错误处理和诊断。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保每个应用程序最多只配置一个OsAppErrorHook；错误钩子函数的实现需要遵循AUTOSAR的错误处理规范；在多应用系统中，每个应用的OsAppErrorHook需要独立配置和实现。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="ZH">错误: 禁用Application遇到不可恢复的错误时执行的钩子函数</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00213</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b0d64ef8-4929-4647-ac16-2c7e541a19a4">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsAppShutdownHook</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Select the OS-Application specific shutdown hook for the OS-Application.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppShutdownHook配置项用于指定操作系统应用程序的ShutdownHook函数，该函数在应用程序被操作系统终止时调用，用于执行必要的清理工作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保OsAppShutdownHook仅在支持ShutdownHook的操作系统中使用；正确配置ShutdownHook以避免在应用程序终止时出现资源泄露；如果应用程序不需要特定的清理操作，可以不配置OsAppShutdownHook。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="ZH">错误: 禁用Application Shutdown时执行的钩子函数</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00125</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d30c7023-7afc-468a-86da-70498ba04654">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsAppStartupHook</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Select the OS-Application specific startup hook for the OS-Application.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsAppStartupHook 配置项用于指定操作系统启动时是否调用应用程序的 Startup Hook 函数，这是一个针对每个应用程序的布尔值配置，用于增强启动时的可定制性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，每个应用程序可以独立配置是否使用Startup Hook；确保在启用此配置时，应用程序中已实现相应的 Hook 函数；过多的 Hook 函数可能会影响系统启动时间，需要谨慎使用。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="ZH">错误: 禁用Application启动时执行的钩子函数</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00124</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3fe22410-f7c0-4ae4-a89a-e6d8c2861115">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsCore</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">The OsCore is used for containing configuration within core scope.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <INTRODUCTION>
                    <P>
                      <L-1 L="ZH">OsCore配置项包含属于该核心的配置信息。</L-1>
                    </P>
                  </INTRODUCTION>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00114</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:487eb46e-c2de-4b01-8138-31906865ee1f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsCoreBswApplicationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the Bsw Application that belongs to this Core.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：配置对属于该核心的 Bsw 应用程序的引用。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00393</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:027f4979-a1d4-4ba0-a615-19a5a8081073">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsCounter</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Configuration information for the counters that belong to the OsApplication.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsCounter是AUTOSAR操作系统中用于计时的对象，它定义了系统或应用程序可以使用的计数器，用于任务调度、事件管理等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：OsCounter的精度和范围受底层硬件计时器的限制；在配置OsCounter时，需要确保其属性与系统的时间需求相匹配；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，OsCounter的配置应遵循操作系统模块的规范，确保与其他系统组件的兼容性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00026</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:77593730-3c82-4979-ba08-f9678e001cf3">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsCounterType</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains the natural type or unit of the counter.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsCounterType配置项用于定义操作系统计数器的类型，这些计数器用于管理操作系统的时间和调度。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，必须确保OsCounterType与系统的时间管理和调度需求相匹配；选择合适的计数器类型对于系统的实时性和性能至关重要；在配置时需注意与硬件资源的兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00255</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:9d735b1c-ec0e-9b0f-4b2d-73c84e61bca2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>HARDWARE</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:11446ab3-f2c1-94ac-28a5-687e992c120a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>SOFTWARE</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7cbe21f0-2e73-4fc2-928e-3337f481cb10">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsSecondsPerTick</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Time of one counter tick in seconds.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSecondsPerTick配置项用于定义操作系统时钟滴答（tick）的时间长度，以秒为单位，这决定了操作系统调度的基本时间单位和精度。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应根据具体硬件平台和系统需求谨慎选择，以平衡系统的实时性和资源消耗；过小的值可能导致CPU过度负载，而过大的值可能影响系统响应时间；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，通常以毫秒或微秒为单位配置时间，因此直接以秒为单位配置可能不符合标准推荐做法。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00030</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>0.001</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.001</MAX>
                      <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.00000001</MIN>
                    </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:deceab52-a44e-40eb-9737-8eea4e860802">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsCounterMaxAllowedValue</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Maximum possible allowed value of the system counter in ticks.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsCounterMaxAllowedValue 定义了操作系统计数器的最大允许值，这是计数器在溢出前可以达到的最大数值。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值必须小于或等于计数器的最大物理值；配置时需考虑系统的实时性和计数器的精度；不正确的配置可能导致系统定时功能的不稳定。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00027</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>1073741823</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX>2147483647</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a0415c2-c296-49d6-b76a-3ce3e75112f3">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsCounterMinCycle</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The MINCYCLE attribute specifies the minimum allowed number of counter ticks for a cyclic scheduletable linked to the counter.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsCounterMinCycle 定义了操作系统计数器的最小周期时间，用于设定计数器的最小递增间隔。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值必须小于或等于OsCounterMaxAllowedValue，以确保计数器的正确循环；若设置过小可能导致系统过度负载；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，应确保此配置与系统时钟和任务调度需求相匹配。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>1</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX>2147483647</MAX>
                      <MIN>1</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:25d694e2-85d2-4c8a-9ceb-6abafafbf40b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsCounterTicksPerBase</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The TICKSPERBASE attribute specifies the number of ticks required to reach a counterspecific unit. The interpretation is implementation-specific.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsCounterTicksPerBase 配置项定义了操作系统计数器的基本时间单元，即每个基本计数单元代表的物理时间“ticks”。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值应与硬件定时器的分辨率相匹配，以确保计数器的准确性；过大或过小的TicksPerBase可能会影响系统的定时精度和性能；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，这个值需要根据具体的硬件和系统需求来合理配置。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00029</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                      <MIN>1</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:48c50338-5eac-440a-860d-4158ed36ae2d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsCounterAccessingApplication</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to applications which have an access to this object.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsCounterAccessingApplication 配置项指定了哪些AUTOSAR应用程序可以访问操作系统的计数器，这是为了确保应用程序能够使用计数器进行时间管理和调度。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保只有被授权的应用程序能够访问特定的计数器；不当的访问权限配置可能会导致系统安全性和稳定性问题；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，需要遵循操作系统模块的访问权限设置规则。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00031</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>32</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5187c6ca-a5b2-4939-b6e0-1d5775ef679e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsDriver</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This Container contains the information who will drive the counter.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsDriver配置项用于定义操作系统(OS)层的驱动组件，这些组件直接与底层的硬件或操作系统服务交互，以提供硬件抽象层（HAL）或操作系统服务给上层软件组件。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，需要确保OsDriver配置与操作系统的支持和硬件抽象层的要求相匹配；OsDriver配置应遵循AUTOSAR OS模块的规范和接口标准；在多核或多分区系统中，还需考虑OsDriver的分配和隔离策略以保证系统的安全性和稳定性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="ZH">该配置仅在计数器类型设置为HARDWARE时有效。若容器不存在（即多重性=0），则定时器由操作系统内部管理（OSINTERNAL）。若容器存在，操作系统可通过GPT接口管理定时器，此时用户必须提供GPT通道。若计数器由操作系统外部其他源驱动（例如TPU模块），则必须通过供应商特定扩展进行描述。</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00371</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6fcce2b4-e71f-42c7-a607-6bf0d4a3e947">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsIsrRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ISR.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsrRef 是一个配置项，用于指定中断服务例程（ISR）与操作系统中断对象的关联，确保系统能够正确识别和处理中断。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsIsrRef时，必须确保引用的中断对象在系统中是唯一的，并且与正确的ISR相对应；此外，中断优先级的设置必须符合系统的实时性要求；在多核系统中，还需要考虑中断的分配策略以确保中断在正确的核上得到处理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsIsr</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:b96dafce-4bed-4761-9f36-2d6e30377bef">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsHardwareTimerChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to hardware timer channel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsHardwareTimerChannelRef 是一个配置参数，用于指定操作系统硬件定时器通道的引用，确保系统能够正确地使用硬件定时器资源。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsHardwareTimerChannelRef时，需要确保引用的硬件定时器通道与实际硬件资源相匹配；此外，必须避免多个操作系统对象引用同一硬件定时器通道，以防止资源冲突；在多核系统中，还需考虑定时器通道与处理器核心的关联性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsPublishedInformation/OsDerivativeInformation/OsHardWareTimer</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:08ff8745-1b33-4b16-829b-c1d7190a6ae6">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsEvent</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Representation of OS events in the configuration context. Adopted from the ISO 17356-6 specification.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsEvent是操作系统级别的事件，用于任务间或中断服务例程（ISR）与任务之间的同步和通信，允许任务在特定事件发生时被唤醒。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保OsEvent与任务和ISR的配置匹配，避免产生资源竞争和优先级反转问题；OsEvent的使用应遵循操作系统的限制和规范，例如事件的最大数量；在多核环境下，注意事件的跨核同步问题。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:51c76d97-345c-4b78-9e45-25dd67fe7095">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsEventMask</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If event mask would be set to AUTO in OIL, this parameter should be omitted here.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsEventMask 配置项用于定义操作系统事件的掩码，这是一个位掩码，用于表示特定任务或中断服务例程（ISR）中等待的事件。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsEventMask时，需要确保每个事件掩码在其所属的任务或ISR中是唯一的；掩码值应与操作系统的事件管理机制兼容；在多任务环境中，正确管理事件掩码以避免优先级反转或死锁问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:7d5716e3-c20e-4559-ba9c-2d90f50cfd28">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsIsr</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">The OsIsr container represents an ISO 17356 interrupt service routine.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsr配置项用于定义中断服务例程（Interrupt Service Routine, ISR）的属性，包括中断源、优先级以及绑定到的OS任务等，确保系统能正确响应外部或内部中断事件。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsIsr时，必须确保中断源与ISR之间的映射关系唯一；优先级设置需符合实际硬件和系统需求，避免优先级反转问题；在多核系统中，还需注意ISR的核间分配和调度策略。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00041</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:97ddd259-bb90-4c42-af70-aa8b24630faf">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsIsrInitialEnableInterruptSource</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameter to specify if interrupt source is enable or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsrInitialEnableInterruptSource 配置项用于定义中断服务例程（ISR）是否在初始化时自动使能其关联的中断源。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项应确保与系统中断管理策略一致；配置不当可能导致系统启动时中断行为不正确；应仔细考虑中断源的启用时机，以避免在系统未完全初始化时产生中断。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00115</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5d95ea52-e3b6-4b84-bc0c-20a37ebfd672">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsIsrCategory</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This attribute specifies the category of this ISR.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsrCategory配置项用于定义中断服务例程（ISR）的类别，这直接影响ISR的属性和它可以调用的操作系统服务类型。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，有效的ISR类别包括1和2；类别1的ISR不能调用那些可能引发阻塞的操作系统服务；类别2的ISR可以调用更多类型的操作系统服务，但使用时需特别注意可能的优先级反转问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00042</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>CATEGORY_2</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:6464a8f3-1fc1-4f7a-8d24-ce9c8427a2a3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CATEGORY_0</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:24186082-92a8-460f-a0c0-7e06153fa0ae">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CATEGORY_TP</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2e25f577-6916-89cb-52c3-cf8f0f997b8f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CATEGORY_1</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0a6f27b6-f20e-940c-51a4-220a88eaa9bc">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CATEGORY_2</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5d95ea52-e3b6-4b84-bc0c-20a37ebfd672">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsIsrInterruptPriority</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This attribute specifies the priority of this ISR.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsrInterruptPriority配置项用于定义中断服务例程（ISR）的优先级，确保系统中断的正确响应和处理顺序。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：优先级设置必须遵循硬件和操作系统的要求，避免优先级反转问题；在多核系统中，还需考虑跨核中断的优先级设置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的配置值需与OS实现和硬件特性相匹配，确保系统稳定运行。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00042</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5d95ea52-e3b6-4b84-bc0c-20a37ebfd672">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsIsrInterruptSource</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This attribute specifies the interrupt source number of this ISR.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsrInterruptSource 配置项用于定义中断服务例程（ISR）所响应的中断源，它指定了ISR应当处理的具体硬件中断或软件中断。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsIsrInterruptSource时，需要确保中断源与ISR之间的映射是唯一的，避免多个ISR响应同一个中断源；中断源的标识符必须符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的硬件资源列表；还需考虑中断优先级，确保高优先级的中断不会被低优先级的中断所屏蔽。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00042</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8986f06e-9232-4f20-aec6-a8dcd936d1e8">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsIsrEntryFunctionName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This attribute specifies the entry function name of this ISR.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsIsrEntryFunctionName 配置项用于定义中断服务例程（ISR）的入口函数名称，这是操作系统用于响应特定中断的函数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保函数名称的唯一性，避免与其他ISR或系统服务的名称冲突；名称应符合C语言标识符的命名规则；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应检查与OS模块的兼容性和配置要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_01024</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                          <MAX-LENGTH>63</MAX-LENGTH>
                          <MIN-LENGTH>1</MIN-LENGTH>
                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8a186c09-bd3e-413f-869f-40b71e71b89e">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsResource</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">An OsResource object is used to co-ordinate the concurrent access by tasks and ISRs to a shared resource, e.g. the scheduler, any program sequence, memory or any hardware area.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsResource 是 AUTOSAR OS模块中定义的资源，用于实现互斥保护，避免系统中的任务或中断服务程序在访问共享资源时出现竞态条件,避免出现优先级反转或死锁等问题。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsResource时，必须确保资源的使用不会导致死锁；资源应当只在必要时被锁定，并在最短可能时间内释放；确保资源的分配遵循AUTOSAR OS的优先级继承或优先级上限协议。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00252</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:00ff7313-1773-4a7c-a3f0-236baeb9dab5">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsResourceProperty</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This specifies the type of the resource.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsResourceProperty配置项用于定义操作系统资源的属性，这些属性包括资源的访问权限、优先级和资源的链接方式等，以确保系统中的任务和中断能够正确地管理和使用资源。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，资源管理应遵循优先级上限协议（Priority Ceiling Protocol）以避免优先级反转问题；资源属性配置必须与系统设计和任务调度策略相匹配；配置时需确保资源的唯一性和正确的优先级分配，以防止资源冲突和死锁。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00050</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>STANDARD</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:5698c562-a95f-8ed7-0be5-0da7c8f7df4f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>INTERNAL</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:36e03569-0663-83dc-127c-89f7f01b051e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>LINKED</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:fe0404bf-255a-8150-0b6e-dc8382946386">
                          <SHORT-NAME>STANDARD</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:feec2b3b-2a1e-4939-a9bf-f1debcd01166">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsResourceAccessingApplication</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to applications which have an access to this object.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsResourceAccessingApplication 配置项用于指定哪些AUTOSAR应用程序可以访问操作系统资源，确保资源的合理分配和访问控制。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保应用程序对资源的访问权限符合系统安全和隔离要求；资源访问权限应与应用程序的信任级别和功能需求相匹配；在多应用程序环境中，避免不同应用程序之间的资源访问冲突。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00051</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>31</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9ce7daad-5838-4fdb-aedd-031c7f5691cd">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsResourceLinkedResourceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The link to the resource. Must be valid if OsResourceProperty is LINKED. If OsResourceProperty is not LINKED the value is ignored.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsResourceLinkedResourceRef 配置项用于指定操作系统资源（OsResource）与其他资源的链接关系，这样可以确保在资源管理中维护正确的优先级继承，避免优先级反转问题。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsResourceLinkedResourceRef时，需要确保引用的资源存在且配置正确；此外，应遵循AUTOSAR OS模块的资源管理策略，避免产生死锁；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对资源链接有明确的规则和限制，需要确保配置符合这些规则。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00052</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsResource</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:523c4517-6584-40ca-957a-8327c5c01843">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTable</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">An OsScheduleTable addresses the synchronization issue by providing an encapsulation of a statically defined set of alarms that cannot be modified at runtime.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTable配置项用于定义操作系统调度表，它规定了操作系统任务和事件的启动模式、周期性及相对时间安排。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsScheduleTable时，需要确保调度表的时间设置不会导致任务或事件的冲突；调度表需与系统实时性要求匹配；在多核系统中，还需考虑调度表在不同核心之间的同步问题。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00141</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c901492e-c50c-45d9-9c20-9448c2f26a40">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableRepeating</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">true: first expiry point on the schedule table shall be processed at final expiry point delay ticks after the final expiry point is processed.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableRepeating配置项用于指定操作系统调度表（Schedule Table）是否应该在完成其时间轴所有事件执行完成后重复执行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，调度表可以配置为单次或重复执行；重复执行的调度表在达到其终点后自动重新开始；确保调度表的设计考虑到系统的实时性要求和任务的周期性约束。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="ZH">错误：调度表处理会在最终到期点被处理时停止。</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00144</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:65aea8af-eeef-43c7-81bf-bec539d2290d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableDuration</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the modulus of the schedule table (in ticks).</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableDuration 配置项用于定义操作系统调度表的周期时间。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsScheduleTableDuration时，需要确保其值满足实时任务的时间要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00053</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f1c26a81-2cfd-4626-8d21-ad2e90b780ad">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableCounterRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains a reference to the counter which drives the schedule table.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableCounterRef配置项用于指定操作系统调度表所依赖的计数器，确保调度表能够根据计数器的值进行任务调度。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：必须确保引用的计数器已经定义且与调度表兼容；在多计数器系统中，选择合适的计数器对于调度精度和性能至关重要；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中是必需的，缺失会导致调度表无法正常工作。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00145</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsCounter</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f3dc4356-37e5-4f5e-9aa9-6f9fbe362508">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsSchTblAccessingApplication</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to applications which have an access to this object.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSchTblAccessingApplication配置项用于指定哪些AUTOSAR应用程序可以访问操作系统的调度表，用于控制对调度表的访问权限，确保系统的安全性和稳定性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保只有被信任的应用程序被授权访问调度表；不当的访问权限配置可能导致系统安全性降低；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于操作系统调度表的访问控制提供了详细的规范，需要严格遵守。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00054</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>32</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ddae46d1-ae87-4bf1-9142-d38f36e01718">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableAutostart</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies if and how the schedule table is started on startup of the Operating System. The options to start a schedule table correspond to the API calls to start schedule tables during runtime.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableAutostart配置项用于定义操作系统调度表的自动启动属性，包括启动条件（如系统启动或特定事件触发）和相对偏移时间。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保调度表的启动条件与系统设计一致，避免因配置错误引发系统启动时序问题；自动启动的调度表应避免与手动启动的调度表冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于OsScheduleTableAutostart的配置应详细考虑其与系统启动级别的关系，确保系统的稳定性和可预测性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00335</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b3a89925-bcbd-4c14-b18d-ce7ab18eab54">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableAutostartType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This specifies the type of the autostart for the schedule table.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableAutostartType定义了操作系统调度表的自动启动类型，指定调度表是在操作系统启动时自动启动，还是通过特定事件触发启动。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值通常包括ABSOLUTE和RELATIVE两种类型，分别对应于系统启动时的绝对时间启动和相对于某个事件的时间启动；在配置时需确保与系统的时间管理策略一致；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对此有明确规定，配置不当可能导致系统启动时序问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00056</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>ABSOLUTE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:4d90b9ec-6db6-9b55-47e5-f1586e6b71d7">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ABSOLUTE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b6e655a1-5810-99b4-2593-9328c8b837fb">
                              <SHORT-NAME>RELATIVE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:a54767b0-3ea1-998b-1e8d-2a218882ea04">
                              <SHORT-NAME>SYNCHRON</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3253c9f1-8291-4424-9258-bd5e22b64bf8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableStartValue</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Absolute autostart tick value when the schedule table starts. Only used if the OsScheduleTableAutostartType is ABSOLUTE.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableStartValue配置项用于定义操作系统调度表的起始时间点，这是一个相对于调度表周期开始的偏移时间，用于确定何时启动调度表中的第一个任务或事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值必须小于或等于调度表的周期长度；在配置时需要确保调度表的起始时间点不会导致任务或事件的执行时间与其他调度活动冲突；调度表的起始时间点应考虑系统启动时的初始化时间，避免过早调度导致的任务执行失败。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="ZH">​​调度表启动的相对节拍偏移量（仅当OsScheduleTableAutostartType为RELATIVE时使用）</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00057</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
